# Regular compound "jar-" (year) + "-dek-" (ten) + "-o", per Esperanto's
# productive compounding rule (en.wikipedia.org "Esperanto grammar",
# compounding) -- not independently attested as a PIV headword, so
# treated as a derived, not curated, surface.  "jardekon" is the singular
# accusative the "ĉiun UNITn" periphrasis takes.
jardeko
jardekoj
jardekon
